OFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfedc204431af3ba6a9f455873de1bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5ac14bc6af3b85c8885a3ee0e7246bd 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62c1bdaca23425bf533a5cfdec1f6efc 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "えぇ⁉︎\nティアキン95時間もやってて、「四方の異変」も残り一ヶ所なのに「ウツシエ」機能、開放してなかった！ですってぇ‼︎⁉︎", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Yuzuha_Virtual/works/92", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfedc204431af3ba6a9f455873de1bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfedc204431af3ba6a9f455873de1bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5ac14bc6af3b85c8885a3ee0e7246bd 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62c1bdaca23425bf533a5cfdec1f6efc 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "失敗してもいい（むしろそれが良い）ので一発録りで早口言葉をいくつかお願いします\n（各 3回ずつ）\n早口言葉の選出、数はお任せします\n\n例＞\n\n・レモンもメロンもペロンと食べた\n・右耳にミニニキビ\n・シチュー死守しつつ 試食し視聴中\n・バナナの謎はまだ謎なのだぞ\n・この釘引き抜きにくい\n・魔術師魔術修行中\n・なかなかカタカナ書けなかったな\n・ママのパジャマはママパジャマ、パパのパジャマはパパパジャマ\n・ある日昼ニヒルなあひるヒルにひるんだ\n・商社の社長が、シチュー死守\n・ラバとロバを比べたらロバかラバかわからなかった\n・カピバラカッパをかっさらう、カッパ葉っぱになりすます\n\nなど\n面白可愛いのがいいかなぁ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Yuzuha_Virtual/works/91", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfedc204431af3ba6a9f455873de1bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfedc204431af3ba6a9f455873de1bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5ac14bc6af3b85c8885a3ee0e7246bd 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62c1bdaca23425bf533a5cfdec1f6efc 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "シャリタツの推しポイント語って欲しいです！好きなものを語っている柚子花ちゃんが聞きたいです", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Yuzuha_Virtual/works/90", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfedc204431af3ba6a9f455873de1bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfedc204431af3ba6a9f455873de1bc, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1879175762772922368%2FCOFF-I9x.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5ac14bc6af3b85c8885a3ee0e7246bd 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.